"https://ironvane-media.com/en/careers/", "hreflang": "en"}, {"rel": "alternate", "href": "https://ironvane-media.com/ru/careers/", "hreflang": "ru"}, {"rel": "alternate", "href": "https://ironvane-media.com/uk/careers/", "hreflang": "uk"}, {"rel": "alternate", "href": "https://ironvane-media.com/es/careers/", "hreflang": "es"}, {"rel": "alternate", "href": "https://ironvane-media.com/cs/careers/", "hreflang": "cs"}, {"rel": "alternate", "href": "https://ironvane-media.com/en/careers/", "hreflang": "x-default"}, {"rel": "alternate", "href": "/en/insights/rss.xml", "type": "application/rss+xml", "title": "Insights — Performance marketing knowledge hub"}], "structuredData": ["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does the interview process work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Five steps over roughly two weeks: application, intro call, paid test task, deep dive, decision. You get feedback at every stage, including if we say no.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there a test task?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and it is paid. It takes three to four hours, mirrors real work, and you keep the rights to it. We do not use candidate tasks on client accounts.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I work remotely?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most roles are fully remote within compatible European time zones. A few are hybrid where the work needs regular time with the account team. It is stated on each role.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What experience do you expect?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Depends on the role — from one year for production to four-plus for account ownership. We care more about how you reason through a messy account than the number of years on a CV.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which markets do you hire from?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Anywhere in Europe and CIS with overlapping working hours. Additional languages — Spanish, Czech, Polish, German, Turkish, Portuguese — genuinely change what you can own here.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does the first month look like?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Week one: measurement, tooling and the accounts. Weeks two to four: shadowing a live account with a named mentor, then owning your first tests. You will present something to the whole team before the month ends.\"}}]}", "{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://ironvane-media.com/en/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Careers\",\"item\":\"https://ironvane-media.com/en/careers/\"}]}"]}, "pre": "<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grain\"></div><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"viz-defs\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"0\" width=\"0\"><defs>\n<pattern height=\"16\" id=\"vzGrid\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M16 0H0V16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.07)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern>\n<lineargradient id=\"mSparkHot\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#7b8cff\" stop-opacity=\"0.45\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#a3b0ff\"></stop></lineargradient>\n<lineargradient id=\"mSparkDim\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.06)\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"rgba(242,240,236,0.24)\"></stop></lineargradient>\n<lineargradient gradientunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" id=\"sparkleGrad\" x1=\"3\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"24\"><stop stop-color=\"#ffffff\"></stop><stop offset=\"0.42\" stop-color=\"#cfd4dd\"></stop><stop offset=\"0.68\" stop-color=\"#7f8490\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ffffff\"></stop></lineargradient>\n<symbol id=\"flag-ru\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><rect fill=\"#fff\" hei