ss=\"num\">01</span><span>About</span></a>\n<a class=\"menu__link\" href=\"/en/services/\" style=\"--i:2\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><span>Services</span></a>\n<a class=\"menu__link\" href=\"/en/pass/\" style=\"--i:3\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><span>Subscriptions</span></a>\n<a class=\"menu__link\" href=\"/en/results/\" style=\"--i:4\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><span>Results</span></a>\n<a class=\"menu__link\" href=\"/en/insights/\" style=\"--i:5\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><span>Insights</span></a>\n<a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"menu__link is-active\" href=\"/en/careers/\" style=\"--i:6\"><span class=\"num\">06</span><span>Careers</span></a>\n<a class=\"menu__link\" href=\"/en/contact/\" style=\"--i:7\"><span class=\"num\">07</span><span>Contact</span></a>\n</nav><div class=\"menu__ext\" data-menu-ext=\"\"><span class=\"mono menu__ext-label\">On Teletype</span><a class=\"menu__ext-link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/AboutUs\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>About the team</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu__ext-link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/IronvaneFAQ\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>FAQ</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu__ext-link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/Session\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>How sessions work</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu__ext-link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/Partnership\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Partnership</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu__ext-link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/IronvanePass\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Ironvane Pass</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"menu__ext menu__ext--tight\" data-menu-ext=\"\"><span class=\"mono menu__ext-label\">On Telegram</span><a class=\"menu__ext-link\" href=\"https://t.me/+-lN8N8R_91UzYjc0\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Team chat</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"menu__foot\">\n<div class=\"menu__contact\">\n<span class=\"mono\">Language</span>\n<div class=\"menu__langs\"><a aria-current=\"true\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"en\" href=\"/en/careers/\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-gb\"></use></svg>EN</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"ru\" href=\"/ru/careers/\" hreflang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-ru\"></use></svg>RU</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"uk\" href=\"/uk/careers/\" hreflang=\"uk\" lang=\"uk\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-ua\"></use></svg>UK</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"es\" href=\"/es/careers/\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-es\"></use></svg>ES</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"cs\" href=\"/cs/careers/\" hreflang=\"cs\" lang=\"cs\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-cz\"></use></svg>CS</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"menu__contact\">\n<span class=\"mono\">General</span>\n<a href=\"mailto:hello@ironvane-media.com\">hello@ironvane-media.com</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div aria-labelledby=\"read-bar-label\" class=\"read-bar\" data-read-bar=\"\" hidden=\"\"><i></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\" id=\"read-bar-label\">Reading progress</span></div>", "main": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Careers</span></nav>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Careers</p>\n<h1 class=\"page-hero__title balance\">We hire people who think in tests.</h1>\n<p class=\"page-hero__lead lead pretty\">Not the loudest, not the fastest to agree. We look for people who can hold a hypothesis, design a fair test for it, and change their mind when the data says so.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--tight ruled\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Why here</p>\n<h2 class=\"h2 balance\">What is different about working here.</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tiles tiles--2\"><div class=\"tile\"><span class=\"tile__num\">01</span><h3 class=\"tile__title\">You own outcomes, not tickets</h3><p class=\"tile__text\">Every person has a metric they are accountable for and the authority to change how it is moved.</p></div>\n<div class=\"tile\"><span class=\"tile__num\">02</span><h3 class=\"tile__title\">Senior density</h3><p class=\"tile__text\">Small teams of experienced people. You will not spend your week explaining fundamentals or fixing someone else's tracking.</p></div>\n<div class=\"tile\"><span class=\"tile__num\">03</span><h3 class=\"tile__title\">Real budgets, real markets</h3><p class=\"tile__text\">You work on live accounts across Europe and CIS from the first month — with a mentor, not a script.</p></div>\n<div class=\"tile\"><span class=\"tile__num\">04</span><h3 class=\"tile__title\">Learning is scheduled, not hoped for</h3><p class=\"tile__text\">Weekly teardown of what won and what failed across all accounts. Wrong answers are useful here; hidden ones are not.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--line\" id=\"roles\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Open roles</p>\n<h2 class=\"h2 balance\">Where we are hiring.</h2>\n<p class=\"lead pretty\">If none of these fit but you believe you belong here, write to us anyway and tell us what you would own.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"jobs\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"job\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"job-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"job__trigger\" data-acc=\"jobs\" type=\"button\">\n<span><span class=\"job__title\">Creative Strategist</span><span class=\"job__sum\">Own the messaging system on live accounts: research the angles, write the hypotheses, and decide what gets produced next.</span></span>\n<span class=\"job__tags\"><span class=\"job__tag\">Full-time</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Remote</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Middle+</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span>\n</button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"job-1\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"job__body\">\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What you will own</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Research audiences, reviews, objections and competitor messaging</li>\n<li>Build angle maps and turn them into written hypotheses</li>\n<li>Write production briefs with a clear variant taxonomy</li>\n<li>Read creative performance data with the analyst and decide what scales</li>\n<li>Maintain the fatigue calendar so refreshes ship before decay</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What we expect</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>2+ years in performance creative, UA or paid social strategy</li>\n<li>You can explain why a creative won without using the word 'engaging'</li>\n<li>Comfortable reading platform and cohort data yourself</li>\n<li>Strong written English; a second European language is a real advantage</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">Nice to have</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Experience with UGC direction</li>\n<li>Worked across more than three markets</li>\n<li>Background in copywriting or research</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com?subject=Creative%20Strategist%20-%20application\"><span>Apply for Creative Strategist</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"btn__icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M1 7h11M8 3l4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"job-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"job__trigger\" data-acc=\"jobs\" type=\"button\">\n<span><span class=\"job__title\">Performance Analyst</span><span class=\"job__sum\">Own the measurement layer: tracking, attribution and the reports that decide where budget moves next week.</span></span>\n<span class=\"job__tags\"><span class=\"job__tag\">Full-time</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Hybrid</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Middle+</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span>\n</button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"job-2\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"job__body\">\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What you will own</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Design and QA event schemas across web and app</li>\n<li>Maintain attribution agreements and reconcile platform vs. internal data</li>\n<li>Build cohort, funnel and payback analysis per market</li>\n<li>Define sample sizes and stopping rules for creative tests</li>\n<li>Turn analysis into a decision report, not a dashboard tour</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What we expect</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>2+ years in marketing analytics, BI or growth analytics</li>\n<li>SQL is second nature; you can build a cohort query without help</li>\n<li>You understand attribution well enough to explain its limits</li>\n<li>You are willing to tell a senior person their favourite campaign is not working</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">Nice to have</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Experience with MMPs (AppsFlyer, Adjust, Branch)</li>\n<li>Incrementality or geo-testing experience</li>\n<li>Python or R for analysis</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com?subject=Performance%20Analyst%20-%20application\"><span>Apply for Performance Analyst</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"btn__icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M1 7h11M8 3l4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"job-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"job__trigger\" data-acc=\"jobs\" type=\"button\">\n<span><span class=\"job__title\">Media Buyer</span><span class=\"job__sum\">Run live budgets across Meta, Google and TikTok with a structure that produces clean signal and defensible decisions.</span></span>\n<span class=\"job__tags\"><span class=\"job__tag\">Full-time</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Remote</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Middle+</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span>\n</button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"job-3\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"job__body\">\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What you will own</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Build and maintain account architecture across platforms</li>\n<li>Execute the weekly optimisation routine and keep the decision log</li>\n<li>Scale proven cells with controlled step sizes</li>\n<li>Coordinate creative rotation with the strategy team</li>\n<li>Own platform compliance and account health</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What we expect</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>2+ years buying media at meaningful monthly volume</li>\n<li>You can defend every budget change with a reason and a number</li>\n<li>Fluent in at least one major platform, literate in the others</li>\n<li>Disciplined with naming, structure and documentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">Nice to have</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>App UA experience</li>\n<li>Multi-market buying</li>\n<li>Familiarity with server-side tracking</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com?subject=Media%20Buyer%20-%20application\"><span>Apply for Media Buyer</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"btn__icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M1 7h11M8 3l4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"job-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"job__trigger\" data-acc=\"jobs\" type=\"button\">\n<span><span class=\"job__title\">Motion Designer</span><span class=\"job__sum\">Produce performance video and motion at testing velocity — variations that isolate one element at a time.</span></span>\n<span class=\"job__tags\"><span class=\"job__tag\">Full-time</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Remote</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Junior+</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span>\n</button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"job-4\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"job__body\">\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What you will own</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Produce video, motion and static variations from written briefs</li>\n<li>Systematically vary hooks, proofs and endings within a batch</li>\n<li>Adapt assets to platform-native formats and aspect ratios</li>\n<li>Localise creative across markets with the strategy team</li>\n<li>Keep delivery on a fixed cadence with correct tagging</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What we expect</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>1+ year producing paid social creative</li>\n<li>Confident in After Effects and a modern editing workflow</li>\n<li>You understand that the first three seconds decide the result</li>\n<li>Fast, organised and comfortable with volume</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">Nice to have</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>UGC editing experience</li>\n<li>Basic 3D or Cinema 4D</li>\n<li>Sound design instincts</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com?subject=Motion%20Designer%20-%20application\"><span>Apply for Motion Designer</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"btn__icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M1 7h11M8 3l4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"job-5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"job__trigger\" data-acc=\"jobs\" type=\"button\">\n<span><span class=\"job__title\">Growth / Acquisition Manager</span><span class=\"job__sum\">Own an account end to end: the target, the plan, the team around it and the number reported at month end.</span></span>\n<span class=\"job__tags\"><span class=\"job__tag\">Full-time</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Hybrid</span><span class=\"job__tag\">Senior</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span>\n</button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"job-5\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"job__body\">\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What you will own</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Own target economics and the acquisition roadmap for an account</li>\n<li>Coordinate creative, buying and analytics into one weekly rhythm</li>\n<li>Lead client communication with evidence, not reassurance</li>\n<li>Plan market expansion with staged pilots and kill criteria</li>\n<li>Forecast volume and cost with defensible assumptions</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">What we expect</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>4+ years in performance marketing, at least one in an ownership role</li>\n<li>You can hold a client conversation about unit economics without slides</li>\n<li>Track record of scaling an account without breaking payback</li>\n<li>Fluent English; Russian, Spanish, Czech or German is an advantage</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"service__col\"><span class=\"service__col-key\">Nice to have</span><ul class=\"tick-list\"><li>Agency and in-house experience</li>\n<li>Multi-market P&amp;L ownership</li>\n<li>Experience hiring or mentoring</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com?subject=Growth%20%2F%20Acquisition%20Manager%20-%20application\"><span>Apply for Growth / Acquisition Manager</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"btn__icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M1 7h11M8 3l4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--line\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Hiring process</p>\n<h2 class=\"h2 balance\">Five steps, roughly two weeks.</h2>\n<p class=\"lead pretty\">You get a decision at every stage, and feedback whether or not it is a yes.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"step__num\">01</span><h3 class=\"step__title\">Application</h3><p class=\"step__text\">Send a short note about what you have run and what you learned. We read every one — a CV alone is rarely enough to tell us anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"step__num\">02</span><h3 class=\"step__title\">Intro call</h3><p class=\"step__text\">30 minutes with the person who would lead your work. Honest conversation about the role, the accounts and the expectations.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"step__num\">03</span><h3 class=\"step__title\">Test task</h3><p class=\"step__text\">A short, paid, realistic task — usually 3 to 4 hours. It reflects actual work, and you keep the rights to what you produce.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"step__num\">04</span><h3 class=\"step__title\">Deep dive</h3><p class=\"step__text\">We go through your task together and work on a live problem. This is where we find out how you think when the data is messy.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"step__num\">05</span><h3 class=\"step__title\">Offer</h3><p class=\"step__text\">Decision and written feedback within three days of the deep dive, whether the answer is yes or no.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--line\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</p>\n<h2 class=\"h2 balance\">Before you apply.</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"accordion\" data-reveal=\"\">\n<div class=\"acc\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"careers-faq-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"acc__trigger\" data-acc=\"exclusive\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"acc__q\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><span>How does the interview process work?</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span></button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"careers-faq-1\" role=\"region\"><div class=\"acc__body\"><p>Five steps over roughly two weeks: application, intro call, paid test task, deep dive, decision. You get feedback at every stage, including if we say no.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"careers-faq-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"acc__trigger\" data-acc=\"exclusive\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"acc__q\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><span>Is there a test task?</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span></button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"careers-faq-2\" role=\"region\"><div class=\"acc__body\"><p>Yes, and it is paid. It takes three to four hours, mirrors real work, and you keep the rights to it. We do not use candidate tasks on client accounts.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"careers-faq-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"acc__trigger\" data-acc=\"exclusive\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"acc__q\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><span>Can I work remotely?</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span></button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"careers-faq-3\" role=\"region\"><div class=\"acc__body\"><p>Most roles are fully remote within compatible European time zones. A few are hybrid where the work needs regular time with the account team. It is stated on each role.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"careers-faq-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"acc__trigger\" data-acc=\"exclusive\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"acc__q\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><span>What experience do you expect?</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span></button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"careers-faq-4\" role=\"region\"><div class=\"acc__body\"><p>Depends on the role — from one year for production to four-plus for account ownership. We care more about how you reason through a messy account than the number of years on a CV.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"careers-faq-5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"acc__trigger\" data-acc=\"exclusive\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"acc__q\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><span>Which markets do you hire from?</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span></button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"careers-faq-5\" role=\"region\"><div class=\"acc__body\"><p>Anywhere in Europe and CIS with overlapping working hours. Additional languages — Spanish, Czech, Polish, German, Turkish, Portuguese — genuinely change what you can own here.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc\">\n<h3><button aria-controls=\"careers-faq-6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"acc__trigger\" data-acc=\"exclusive\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"acc__q\"><span class=\"num\">06</span><span>What does the first month look like?</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"acc__icon\"></span></button></h3>\n<div class=\"acc__panel\" id=\"careers-faq-6\" role=\"region\"><div class=\"acc__body\"><p>Week one: measurement, tooling and the accounts. Weeks two to four: shadowing a live account with a named mentor, then owning your first tests. You will present something to the whole team before the month ends.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cta-band\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sparkle cta-band__spark\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"34\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"34\"><path d=\"M12 0c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12C6.627 12 12 6.627 12 0Z\" fill=\"url(#sparkleGrad)\"></path></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sparkle sparkle--sm cta-band__spark cta-band__spark--b\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"18\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M12 0c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12C6.627 12 12 6.627 12 0Z\" fill=\"url(#sparkleGrad)\"></path></svg>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"cta-band__inner\" data-reveal=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"cta-band__title balance\">Think you belong here?</h2>\n<p class=\"cta-band__lead pretty\">Send a short note about what you have run, what you learned and what you want to own next. A CV helps, but the note matters more.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com\"><span>Apply</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"btn__icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M1 7h11M8 3l4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n", "footer": "\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"footer__top\">\n<div class=\"footer__brand\">\n<a aria-label=\"Ironvane Media\" class=\"logo\" href=\"/en/\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"logo__mark\" fill=\"none\" height=\"22\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\"><defs><lineargradient gradientunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" id=\"ivmMarkf\" x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"24\"><stop stop-color=\"#ffffff\"></stop><stop offset=\"0.45\" stop-color=\"#c9ccd2\"></stop><stop offset=\"0.7\" stop-color=\"#82868f\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ffffff\"></stop></lineargradient></defs><path d=\"M12 0c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12C6.627 12 12 6.627 12 0Z\" fill=\"url(#ivmMarkf)\"></path></svg>\n<span class=\"logo__type\"><span class=\"logo__name\">Ironvane Media</span><span class=\"logo__sub\">Performance systems</span></span>\n</a>\n<p class=\"footer__tagline\">A European performance marketing company. Creative strategy, media buying and analytics, run as one system across 73 markets.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer__col\"><span class=\"footer__key\">Company</span><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/about/\">About</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/pass/\">Subscriptions</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/verticals/\">Verticals</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/results/\">Results</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/careers/\">Careers</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/contact/\">Contact</a></div>\n<div class=\"footer__col\"><span class=\"footer__key\">Services</span><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/services/#creative-strategy\">Creative Strategy</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/services/#performance-marketing\">Performance Marketing</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/services/#analytics\">Analytics</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/services/#cro\">Conversion Rate Optimisation</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/services/#market-expansion\">Market Expansion</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/services/#creative-production\">Creative Production</a></div>\n<div class=\"footer__col\"><span class=\"footer__key\">Resources</span><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/insights/\">Insights</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/insights/\">Creative strategy</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/insights/\">Analytics</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"/en/insights/\">Creative testing</a></div>\n<div class=\"footer__col\"><span class=\"footer__key\">Connect</span><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"mailto:hello@ironvane-media.com\">hello@ironvane-media.com</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com\">careers@ironvane-media.com</a>\n<a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://t.me/ironvane\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Telegram</a></div>\n<div class=\"footer__col footer__col--langs\"><span class=\"footer__key\">Language</span><div class=\"footer__langs\"><a aria-current=\"true\" class=\"footer__lang\" data-lang=\"en\" href=\"/en/careers/\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-gb\"></use></svg>EN</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"footer__lang\" data-lang=\"ru\" href=\"/ru/careers/\" hreflang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-ru\"></use></svg>RU</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"footer__lang\" data-lang=\"uk\" href=\"/uk/careers/\" hreflang=\"uk\" lang=\"uk\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-ua\"></use></svg>UK</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"footer__lang\" data-lang=\"es\" href=\"/es/careers/\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-es\"></use></svg>ES</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"footer__lang\" data-lang=\"cs\" href=\"/cs/careers/\" hreflang=\"cs\" lang=\"cs\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-cz\"></use></svg>CS</a></div></div><div class=\"footer__col\" data-foot-tt=\"\"><span class=\"footer__key\">On Teletype</span><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/AboutUs\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">About the team</a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/IronvaneFAQ\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FAQ</a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/Session\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How sessions work</a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/Partnership\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Partnership</a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://teletype.in/@ironvane/IronvanePass\" hreflang=\"ru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ironvane Pass</a></div><div class=\"footer__col\" data-foot-tg=\"\"><span class=\"footer__key\">On Telegram</span><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://t.me/+-lN8N8R_91UzYjc0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Team chat</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer__bottom\">\n<p class=\"footer__legal\">All trademarks and case codenames are the property of their respective owners. Client identities and verified performance figures are shared under NDA.</p>\n<div class=\"footer__meta\">\n<span>© 2026 Ironvane Media. All rights reserved.</span>\n<a href=\"/en/legal/\">Legal</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n", "post": "<button aria-label=\"Back to top\" class=\"to-top\" data-to-top=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M7 12V2M3 6l4-4 4 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></button>"}